<title>HONG KONG: Asia Securities H1 net loss HK$45.26 mln.</title>
<headline>Asia Securities H1 net loss HK$45.26 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   7.8 loss   vs  4.4 gain</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  25.93 loss vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    45.26 loss vs  25.55 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		     64.97	vs 171.81</p>
<p>    Company name		 Asia Securities International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Asia Securities engages in property investment and development, investment holding, underwriting and securities trading.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss from securities trading.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
